1276	/****************************************************************************
1277	 * Name: sg2000_eth_initialize
1278	 *
1279	 * Description:
1280	 *   Initialize the SG2000 Ethernet driver and register it with the OpenVela
1281	 *   network stack as a netdev_lowerhalf_s device.
